      "id": "grep-renders-a-throw-and-a-rejection-by-their-types",
      "ask": "How does `grep` render a RAISE whose `exc.kind` is `throw` and a HANDLED whose `exc.kind` is `rejection` -- by the type the program used, or by the kind?",
      "command": ["grep", "$RUN", ""],
      "expect_exit": 0,
      "expect_contains": [
